<title>USA: Rockford Park Dist, Ill., won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Rockford Park Dist, Ill., won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it won $6.825 million of Rockford Park Dist., Ill., general obligation park bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.4374 percent.</p>
